{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the streets of Nuevo Tokyo in this special demo version of <i>Mexican Ninja</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo gives you a sneak peek at the chaos to come, featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 playable stage</strong> packed with Narkuza enemies to slice, smash, and suplex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A taste of <strong>El Ninja\u2019s core abilities</strong>, including melee combos, dashes, and special attacks like the boomerang sombrero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-boss encounter</strong> that will test your reflexes and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. <strong>45\u201360 minutes of gameplay</strong>, depending on how chaotic you get and how much meta progression you want to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just a slice of the full game - enough to give you a feel for the combat, style, and humor behind Mexican Ninja. The full release will include multiple stages, diverse bosses, deeper abilities, and more chaotic surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your blade, test your combos, and get a taste of the rebellion. \ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/7f0f81c2d9428b6488633b4b0aeb6586.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=97 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story takes place in Nuevo-Tokyo, an offspring of chaos that was born when Japan and Mexico collided in fire, power and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A land where a new feudal regime was forged between Narcos and Yakuzas, forming a new ruling class, The Narkuzas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are now the law, and the law <strong><i>SUCKS CULO</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in the outskirts of Nuevo-Tokyo, a group of rebels is plotting against the five heads of the Narkuza clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Mexican Ninja\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/159a4faaec4c4c00c9ef753d4a4e2f36.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/159a4faaec4c4c00c9ef753d4a4e2f36.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/159a4faaec4c4c00c9ef753d4a4e2f36.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5b8d0787f01c4340e7d4a738969004b4.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pela el oido, I\u2019m going to tell you a story, eh?  One full of adrenaline-pumping combat, where the streets never give you a break, no matter how many fall before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the stylized streets of Nuevo Tokyo where Narcos and Yakuzas joined forces, and mi pueblo was never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise movement, positioning, and perfectly timed attacks are all crucial to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a satisfying, pick-up-and-play brawler that\u2019s deceptively simple, yet rewards those who master it.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d6be3e2b0b380f138c45bb8a03662f81.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d6be3e2b0b380f138c45bb8a03662f81.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d6be3e2b0b380f138c45bb8a03662f81.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/1fb4fea24864ab200e98e672bf68a77a.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ninja skills by training with el Mero Mero Sensei. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the favor of Mexican-Japanese spirits, and use their powers throughout the runs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use extremely ninja Mexican Jutsus.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different builds and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swag it up with hidden apparel for your Ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d8c642c079119f3166fc1e84eb2fe0e8.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d8c642c079119f3166fc1e84eb2fe0e8.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d8c642c079119f3166fc1e84eb2fe0e8.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/f93e84f32bd18a073be34cf4d391d9cc.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mexican Ninja might be a true return to the button-mashing classics, but we got huevos. By &quot;huevos&quot; we mean their huevos, your enemies, on the floor. Because when we kill, we do it <strong>CON HUEVOS CABRON</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighting style using our Way of the Donkey tree. It\u2019s like a skill tree, but 10x cooler,\u00a0for people with peluche en el estuche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/87be04e20b7ad8c32f27cd3a47a40516.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/87be04e20b7ad8c32f27cd3a47a40516.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/87be04e20b7ad8c32f27cd3a47a40516.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/0b75aa04b9c80ebb1cc14ba56fc52c66.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s an inner cabr\u00f3n in all of us. Be <strong><i>THE</i></strong> Mexican Ninja and show off your unmatched way of the blade!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5c389a12c75711534c9679f162658879.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5c389a12c75711534c9679f162658879.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5c389a12c75711534c9679f162658879.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testimonials</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I couldn\u2019t be prouder of what the whole Amber team has helped us build and bring to life through this video game. In my culture, a HERO was always needed\u2026 ****, it still is\u2026 Mexican Ninja has always been about that to me - the longing for that idea. Having profound admiration for Japanese culture, its history, and its roots, it naturally seemed like the perfect one to blend and contrast with my own. I hope players can join the fun, explore the world, and embrace all the quirks of this concept. I hope they get their asses kicked and stand up again, and again, and again\u2014and through this dynamic, understand that Mexican Ninja is a vibe, a spirit, a way of being. I wish you a good journey in finding your inner donkey.   Stay blazed&quot; <br><strong>Carlos Rincones </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/456e58a73504bdf93dcef834b6f898d0.avif?t=1759492006\" width=1491 height=1187 /></span><strong> </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057760?t=1759492006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/aa6621e8644676b0b6baa2b55e8ed62bebdfddcb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759492006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/784c8d65bb83346a6d356827567ff8bfa65794c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759492006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/784c8d65bb83346a6d356827567ff8bfa65794c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759492006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the streets of Nuevo Tokyo in this special demo version of <i>Mexican Ninja</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo gives you a sneak peek at the chaos to come, featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 playable stage</strong> packed with Narkuza enemies to slice, smash, and suplex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A taste of <strong>El Ninja\u2019s core abilities</strong>, including melee combos, dashes, and special attacks like the boomerang sombrero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-boss encounter</strong> that will test your reflexes and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. <strong>45\u201360 minutes of gameplay</strong>, depending on how chaotic you get and how much meta progression you want to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just a slice of the full game - enough to give you a feel for the combat, style, and humor behind Mexican Ninja. The full release will include multiple stages, diverse bosses, deeper abilities, and more chaotic surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your blade, test your combos, and get a taste of the rebellion. \ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/7f0f81c2d9428b6488633b4b0aeb6586.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=97 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story takes place in Nuevo-Tokyo, an offspring of chaos that was born when Japan and Mexico collided in fire, power and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A land where a new feudal regime was forged between Narcos and Yakuzas, forming a new ruling class, The Narkuzas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are now the law, and the law <strong><i>SUCKS CULO</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in the outskirts of Nuevo-Tokyo, a group of rebels is plotting against the five heads of the Narkuza clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Mexican Ninja\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/159a4faaec4c4c00c9ef753d4a4e2f36.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/159a4faaec4c4c00c9ef753d4a4e2f36.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/159a4faaec4c4c00c9ef753d4a4e2f36.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5b8d0787f01c4340e7d4a738969004b4.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pela el oido, I\u2019m going to tell you a story, eh?  One full of adrenaline-pumping combat, where the streets never give you a break, no matter how many fall before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the stylized streets of Nuevo Tokyo where Narcos and Yakuzas joined forces, and mi pueblo was never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise movement, positioning, and perfectly timed attacks are all crucial to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a satisfying, pick-up-and-play brawler that\u2019s deceptively simple, yet rewards those who master it.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d6be3e2b0b380f138c45bb8a03662f81.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d6be3e2b0b380f138c45bb8a03662f81.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d6be3e2b0b380f138c45bb8a03662f81.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/1fb4fea24864ab200e98e672bf68a77a.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ninja skills by training with el Mero Mero Sensei. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the favor of Mexican-Japanese spirits, and use their powers throughout the runs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use extremely ninja Mexican Jutsus.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different builds and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swag it up with hidden apparel for your Ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d8c642c079119f3166fc1e84eb2fe0e8.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d8c642c079119f3166fc1e84eb2fe0e8.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/d8c642c079119f3166fc1e84eb2fe0e8.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/f93e84f32bd18a073be34cf4d391d9cc.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mexican Ninja might be a true return to the button-mashing classics, but we got huevos. By &quot;huevos&quot; we mean their huevos, your enemies, on the floor. Because when we kill, we do it <strong>CON HUEVOS CABRON</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighting style using our Way of the Donkey tree. It\u2019s like a skill tree, but 10x cooler,\u00a0for people with peluche en el estuche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/87be04e20b7ad8c32f27cd3a47a40516.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/87be04e20b7ad8c32f27cd3a47a40516.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/87be04e20b7ad8c32f27cd3a47a40516.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/0b75aa04b9c80ebb1cc14ba56fc52c66.avif?t=1759492006\" width=604 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s an inner cabr\u00f3n in all of us. Be <strong><i>THE</i></strong> Mexican Ninja and show off your unmatched way of the blade!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5c389a12c75711534c9679f162658879.poster.avif?t=1759492006\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5c389a12c75711534c9679f162658879.webm?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/5c389a12c75711534c9679f162658879.mp4?t=1759492006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testimonials</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I couldn\u2019t be prouder of what the whole Amber team has helped us build and bring to life through this video game. In my culture, a HERO was always needed\u2026 ****, it still is\u2026 Mexican Ninja has always been about that to me - the longing for that idea. Having profound admiration for Japanese culture, its history, and its roots, it naturally seemed like the perfect one to blend and contrast with my own. I hope players can join the fun, explore the world, and embrace all the quirks of this concept. I hope they get their asses kicked and stand up again, and again, and again\u2014and through this dynamic, understand that Mexican Ninja is a vibe, a spirit, a way of being. I wish you a good journey in finding your inner donkey.   Stay blazed&quot; <br><strong>Carlos Rincones </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/extras/456e58a73504bdf93dcef834b6f898d0.avif?t=1759492006\" width=1491 height=1187 /></span><strong> </strong></p>","developers":["Madbricks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3764970","name":"Mexican Ninja"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057760/effda8b9c3ebc2f8f49e3fd850d20ce71dca2e9d/header.jpg?t=1759492006","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057760/1278321293/6583276e5bf8986d056bab07f7244b8263eea46a/1758872450/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759392220","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057760/1278321293/6583276e5bf8986d056bab07f7244b8263eea46a/1758872450/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759392220","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057760/1278321293/6583276e5bf8986d056bab07f7244b8263eea46a/1758872450/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759392220","id":257206693,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206693/movie480.mp4?t=1759392220","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206693/movie_max.